# CLI Calculator

A command-line calculator written in Go without using `strconv` or `fmt`.

## Features

- Addition (+)
- Subtraction (-)
- Multiplication (\*)
- Division (/)
- Modulo (%)
- Overflow detection
- Custom integer parsing
- Custom integer formatting

## Usage

go run . 10 + 5
go run . 8 "\*" 7
go run . 20 / 4
